@{ ViewData["Title"] = "Controlled fault lab"; }
<div class="page-heading mb-4"><div><div class="eyebrow">SAFE FAILURE PRACTICE</div><h1>Controlled fault lab</h1><p class="text-secondary mb-0">Use deterministic simulator scenarios. Each preset affects new lab items only and never rewrites settled data.</p></div><a asp-action="Index">Learning Center</a></div>
<div class="challenge-grid">
<article class="surface challenge-card"><span>WIRE</span><h2 class="h4">Pending then accepted</h2><p>Observe an intermediate PDNG state before final acceptance.</p><a class="btn btn-outline-primary" asp-controller="Wires" asp-action="Create" asp-route-scenario="PendingThenAccepted">Create controlled wire</a></article>
<article class="surface challenge-card"><span>WIRE</span><h2 class="h4">Network rejection</h2><p>Prove delivery, business rejection, hold release, and absence of settlement.</p><a class="btn btn-outline-primary" asp-controller="Wires" asp-action="Create" asp-route-scenario="FedRejects">Create rejected wire</a></article>
<article class="surface challenge-card"><span>WIRE</span><h2 class="h4">Malformed ISO</h2><p>Observe profile validation stopping transport before settlement.</p><a class="btn btn-outline-primary" asp-controller="Wires" asp-action="Create" asp-route-scenario="MalformedIso">Create malformed case</a></article>
<article class="surface challenge-card"><span>RELIABILITY</span><h2 class="h4">Duplicate delivery</h2><p>Deliver final messages twice and prove that settlement and customer posting occur once.</p><a class="btn btn-outline-primary" asp-controller="Wires" asp-action="Create" asp-route-scenario="DuplicateDelivery">Create duplicate case</a></article>
<article class="surface challenge-card"><span>RELIABILITY</span><h2 class="h4">Out-of-order delivery</h2><p>Receive a stale pending status after final acceptance and use payment truth rather than arrival order.</p><a class="btn btn-outline-primary" asp-controller="Wires" asp-action="Create" asp-route-scenario="OutOfOrderDelivery">Create ordering case</a></article>
<article class="surface challenge-card"><span>RELIABILITY</span><h2 class="h4">Dropped first delivery</h2><p>Observe a controlled delay and keep the payment pending without premature posting.</p><a class="btn btn-outline-primary" asp-controller="Wires" asp-action="Create" asp-route-scenario="DroppedDelivery">Create delayed case</a></article>
<article class="surface challenge-card"><span>ACH</span><h2 class="h4">File/control failures</h2><p>Select MalformedFile or ControlTotalMismatch and distinguish file rejection from an RDFI return.</p><a class="btn btn-outline-primary" asp-controller="Ach" asp-action="Create">Create ACH case</a></article>
<article class="surface challenge-card"><span>CHECK</span><h2 class="h4">Duplicate and image failures</h2><p>Select DuplicatePresentment or PoorImageQuality and verify no invalid value posting.</p><a class="btn btn-outline-primary" asp-controller="Check" asp-action="Instructions">Prepare check case</a></article>
<article class="surface challenge-card"><span>RECOVERY</span><h2 class="h4">Durable replay</h2><p>Operations users can inspect dead letters and replay once. Compare delivery attempts with journals to prove idempotency.</p><a class="btn btn-outline-primary" asp-controller="Operations" asp-action="Index">Open recovery controls</a></article>
</div>
<aside class="production-callout mt-4"><strong>Lab boundary</strong><span>These are deterministic teaching scenarios, not network fault certification, chaos testing, or evidence of production resilience.</span></aside>
